This directory is intentionally empty.

Benchmark results land here when `make bench` is run. Nothing in this repository
has been executed, so there are no results yet, and every performance figure in
the README and in docs/expected-performance.md is a model-derived projection
rather than a measurement.

Once results exist here:
  * `python3 tools/make_report.py` turns them into bench/report.html
  * the "Measured results" table in README.md can be filled in
  * the placeholder tokens in the README's resume bullets can be substituted

Until then, do not cite any performance number from this project anywhere.
